  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/elripalda/RecompStore/zipball/v2.7.4",
  "body": "## RecompStore 2.7.4\r\n\r\n- Setting up a game is faster: disc images on the same drive as the game are moved into place instead of copied, so it takes a second and doesn't need room for a second copy. Files from another drive, like a USB stick, are still copied.\r\n- Game pages with lots of files to set up now fit their panel. It scrolls to whatever you're on, with a scroll bar on its edge.\r\n\r\nSomething not working right? Send your logs from the app's page in RecompStore. Every log helps.\r\n\r\n## Installing\r\nUpdate from inside the store, or send RecompStore-Installer.elf with your payload sender.",
